'''Bleached''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 4]] or through trading.

== Appearance ==
It’s blade is a dull white with a bleach-like texture, hence the name. The guard is a shiny silver color, and the handle is dark gray.
